#: data/resources/ui/export_dialog.blp:60
msgid ""
"Export all the data Pipeline stores, in order to backup the data or import "
"into another Pipeline instance"
msgstr ""
"Izvezite sve podatke koje Pipeline pohranjuje kako biste napravili "
"sigurnosnu kopiju podataka ili ih uvezli u drugu instancu Pipeline-a"

#: data/resources/ui/export_dialog.blp:76
msgid ""
"Export as a YouTube CSV format. While YouTube itself cannot import it, it "
"can be used in other applications. This only exports YouTube subscriptions"
msgstr ""
"Izvezi kao YouTube CSV format. Iako sam YouTube ne može da ga uveze, može se "
"koristiti u drugim aplikacijama. Ovo izvozi samo YouTube pretplate"

#: data/resources/ui/export_dialog.blp:92
msgid ""
"Produces a JSON file with your subscriptions which can be imported into "
"NewPipe"
msgstr ""
"Proizvodi JSON datoteku s vašim pretplatama koja se može uvesti u NewPipe"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:5 data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:8
msgid "Manage Filters"
msgstr "Upravljaj filterima"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:19
msgid "Use Filters"
msgstr "Koristite filtere"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:20
msgid "Hide videos from the feed"
msgstr "Sakrij videozapise iz napajanja"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:26
msgid "General Filters"
msgstr "Opći filteri"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:30
msgid "Hide Watched Videos"
msgstr "Sakrij gledane videozapise"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:31
msgid "Hide videos you have already watched from the feed"
msgstr "Sakrijte videozapise koje ste već gledali iz napajanja"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:35
msgid "Hide Short Videos"
msgstr "Sakrij kratke videozapise"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:36
msgid "Hide videos shorter than one minute from the feed"
msgstr "Sakrij videozapise kraće od jedne minute iz napajanja"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:40
msgid "Hide Payed Videos"
msgstr "Sakrij plaćene videozapise"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:41
msgid "Hide videos that require a payment from the feed"
msgstr "Sakrij videozapise koji zahtijevaju plaćanje iz napajanja"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:45
msgid "Hide Videos from Today"
msgstr "Sakrij današnje videozapise"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:46
msgid "Hide videos that came out today from the feed"
msgstr "Sakrij videozapise koji su danas objavljeni iz napajanja"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:52
#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:57
msgid "Custom Filters"
msgstr "Prilagođeni filteri"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:59
msgid ""
"Hide a channel's videos whose titles contain a certain word or phrase\n"
"\n"
"You can create custom filters either here or prepopulate the information "
"from a video's context menu"
msgstr ""
"Sakrijte videozapise kanala čiji naslovi sadrže određenu riječ ili frazu\n"
"\n"
"Možete kreirati prilagođene filtere ovdje ili unaprijed popuniti informacije "
"iz kontekstnog menija videozapisa"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_dialog.blp:71
#: data/resources/ui/filter_similar_dialog.blp:5
#: data/resources/ui/filter_similar_dialog.blp:28
msgid "Add Filter"
msgstr "Dodaj filter"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_similar_dialog.blp:7
msgid ""
"Hide videos from the feed if they contain a specific phrase in their titles "
"and were uploaded by a specific channel"
msgstr ""
"Sakrij videozapise iz napajanja ako sadrže određenu frazu u naslovu i ako ih "
"je postavio određeni kanal"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_similar_dialog.blp:17
msgid "Phrase to Filter"
msgstr "Fraza za filtriranje"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_similar_dialog.blp:21
msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Kanal"

#: data/resources/ui/filter_similar_dialog.blp:29
#: src/gui/preferences_dialog.rs:545
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Otkaži"

#: data/resources/ui/import_dialog.blp:62
msgid ""
"Importing data from a previous Pipeline export will overwrite all current "
"data. Restarting is recommended after importing"
msgstr ""
"Uvoz podataka iz prethodnog izvoza u Pipeline će prepisati sve trenutne "
"podatke. Preporučuje se ponovno pokretanje nakon uvoza"

#: data/resources/ui/import_dialog.blp:78
msgid ""
"To import subscriptions from YouTube, you need to export your subscriptions "
"as a CSV from <a href=\"https://takeout.google.com/settings/takeout/"
"downloads\">Google Takeout</a>. Afterwards, select the downloaded file to "
"import it into Pipeline"
msgstr ""
"Da biste uvezli pretplate s YouTubea, potrebno je da izvezete svoje "
"pretplate kao CSV datoteku iz <a href=\"https://takeout.google.com/settings/"
"takeout/downloads\">Google Takeouta</a>. Nakon toga, odaberite preuzetu "
"datoteku da biste je uvezli u Pipeline"

#: data/resources/ui/import_dialog.blp:95
msgid ""
"To import subscriptions from NewPipe, you need to export your subscriptions "
"to a JSON file. Afterwards, select the downloaded file to import it into "
"Pipeline"
msgstr ""
"Da biste uvezli pretplate iz NewPipe-a, potrebno je da ih izvezete u JSON "
"datoteku. Nakon toga, odaberite preuzetu datoteku da biste je uvezli u "
"Pipeline"

#: data/resources/ui/import_dialog.blp:111
msgid ""
"To import subscriptions from Invidious, you need to export your "
"subscriptions to a JSON file. Afterwards, select the downloaded file to "
"import it into Pipeline"
msgstr ""
"Da biste uvezli pretplate iz Invidious-a, potrebno je da ih izvezete u JSON "
"datoteku. Nakon toga, odaberite preuzetu datoteku da biste je uvezli u "
"Pipeline"

