msgstr "Dozvoli Pipeline-u da preuzima YouTube videozapise"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:94
msgid "Prefer Fetching Information Directly from YouTube"
msgstr "Preferiram preuzimanje informacija direktno s YouTubea"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:95
msgid "On errors, try to fetch information using Piped. Recommended."
msgstr ""
"U slučaju grešaka, pokušajte preuzeti informacije koristeći Piped. "
"Preporučeno."

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:103
msgid "Prefer Fetching Information Using Piped"
msgstr "Preferiram dohvaćanje informacija putem Pipeda"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:104
msgid "On errors, try to fetch information from YouTube"
msgstr "U slučaju grešaka, pokušajte preuzeti informacije s YouTubea"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:112
msgid "Always Fetch Information Directly from YouTube"
msgstr "Uvijek preuzmi informacije direktno s YouTubea"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:120
msgid "Always Fetch Information Using Piped"
msgstr "Uvijek dohvati informacije koristeći Piped"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:136
msgid "YouTube Cookies File"
msgstr "Datoteka YouTube kolačića"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:137
msgid "No cookies file used"
msgstr "Nije korištena datoteka kolačića"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:142
msgid "Choose a cookies file"
msgstr "Odaberite datoteku kolačića"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:148
msgid "Remove cookies file"
msgstr "Uklonite datoteku kolačića"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:153
msgid "Extractor Arguments for yt-dlp"
msgstr "Argumenti za izdvajanje za yt-dlp"

#: data/resources/ui/preferences_dialog.blp:166
msgid ""
"Specify the list of instances to use. Pipeline can maintain this list "
"automatically, which will refresh it on every startup. You can freely modify "
"this list if you have your own Piped instances you want to use. The requests "
"will be balanced across all listed instances. For a complete list of public "
"APIs, see the <a href=\"https://github.com/TeamPiped/documentation/blob/main/"
"content/docs/public-instances/index.md\">Instances page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Navedite listu primjeraka koje ćete koristiti. Pipeline može automatski "
"održavati ovu listu, što će je osvježavati pri svakom pokretanju. Možete "
"slobodno mijenjati ovu listu ako imate vlastite Piped primjerke koje želite "
"koristiti. Zahtjevi će biti uravnoteženi između svih navedenih primjeraka. "
"Za potpunu listu javnih API-ja, pogledajte <a href=\"https://github.com/"
"TeamPiped/documentation/blob/main/content/docs/public-instances/"
"index.md\">stranicu Instance</a>."

