#: data/resources/ui/privacy_notice.blp:47
msgid ""
"Pipeline connects directly to YouTube and PeerTube for getting data and when "
"playing videos. Pipeline can be configured to use Piped for retrieving "
"Youtube data, but videos are still played over YouTube"
msgstr ""
"Pipeline se direktno povezuje na YouTube i PeerTube radi prikupljanja "
"podataka i reprodukcije videa. Pipeline se može podesiti da koristi Piped za "
"preuzimanje podataka s YouTubea, ali se videozapisi i dalje reproduciraju "
"preko YouTubea"

