#: src/splashes.rs:11
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pipeline was once called Tubefeeder."
msgstr "Pipeline se nekada zvao Tubefeeder."

#: src/splashes.rs:17
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline was built for mobile linux devices like the PinePhone. That it "
"works on desktops is just a happy side effect."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline je napravljen za mobilne Linux uređaje poput PinePhone-a. To što "
"radi na desktop računarima je samo srećna nuspojava."

#: src/splashes.rs:23
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "The first commit of Pipeline was {} days ago."
msgstr "Prvo ažuriranje Pipeline-a je bilo prije {} dana."

#: src/splashes.rs:35
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "You are running commit number {} of Pipeline."
msgstr "Koristite potvrđeni broj {} Pipeline-a."

#: src/splashes.rs:42
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "You are running release number {} of Pipeline."
msgstr "Koristite verziju broj {} Pipeline-a."

#: src/splashes.rs:49
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pipeline is built from {} lines of Rust code."
msgstr "Pipeline je izgrađen od {} linija Rust koda."

#: src/splashes.rs:56
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pipeline is built from {} lines of Blueprint UI markup."
msgstr "Pipeline je izgrađen od {} linija Blueprint UI markup-a."

#: src/splashes.rs:64
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "There are {} different splash texts which can be displayed here."
msgstr "Ovdje se može prikazati {} različitih uvodnih tekstova."

#. Translators: "Splash" as in the splash text from Minecraft: https://minecraft.wiki/w/Splash.
#: src/splashes.rs:74
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"In expectation, you will need to reload {} times to have seen all splash "
"texts at least once."
msgstr ""
"Očekuje se da ćete morati ponovo učitati {} puta da biste barem jednom "
"vidjeli sve uvodne tekstove."

#: src/splashes.rs:80
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline is translated in {languages} different languages by {translators} "
"translators"
msgstr ""
"Pipeline je preveden na {languages} različitih jezika od strane "
"{translators} prevodilaca"

#: src/splashes.rs:94
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can help translate Pipeline using <a href=\"https://hosted.weblate.org/"
"engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."
msgstr ""
"Možete pomoći u prevođenju Pipeline-a koristeći <a href=\"https://"
"hosted.weblate.org/engage/schmiddi-on-mobile/\">Weblate</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:100
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The source code of Pipeline is hosted on <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/"
"schmiddi-on-mobile/pipeline\">GitLab</a>."
msgstr ""
"Izvorni kod Pipeline-a se nalazi na <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/schmiddi-on-"
"mobile/pipeline\">GitLabu</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:106
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We have a <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix "
"room</a> where you can come and talk with us."
msgstr ""
"Imamo <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix sobu</"
"a> gdje možete doći i razgovarati s nama."

#: src/splashes.rs:112
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has a <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/pipeline\">website</"
"a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline ima <a href=\"https://mobile.schmidhuberj.de/pipeline\">web "
"stranicu</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:118
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can get Pipeline on <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathub</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline možete nabaviti na <a href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/"
"de.schmidhuberj.tubefeeder\">Flathubu</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:124
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/clapper\">Clapper</a> as the "
"video player."
msgstr ""
"Kao video čitač koristimo <a href=\"https://github.com/Rafostar/"
"clapper\">Clapper</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:130
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"We use <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</a> "
"and <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> to get data from YouTube."
msgstr ""
"Koristimo <a href=\"https://codeberg.org/ThetaDev/rustypipe/\">rustypipe</a> "
"i <a href=\"https://piped.video/\">Piped</a> za dobijanje podataka sa "
"YouTubea."

#: src/splashes.rs:136
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"The creator of Pipeline has also built other applications, like <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> and <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tvorac Pipeline-a je također izgradio i druge aplikacije, kao što su <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.DieBahn\">Railway</a> i <a "
"href=\"https://flathub.org/apps/de.schmidhuberj.Flare\">Flare</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:142
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"When using Piped to fetch data, Pipeline will be able to fetch your "
"subscriptions faster with more public Piped instances. So consider <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hosting Piped</a> and "
"making it available for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Kada koristite Piped za preuzimanje podataka, Pipeline će moći brže preuzeti "
"vaše pretplate s više javnih Piped instanci. Stoga razmislite o <a "
"href=\"https://docs.piped.video/docs/self-hosting/\">hostovanju Pipeda</a> i "
"njegovom omogućavanju svima."

#: src/splashes.rs:148
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"No animals were harmed while making this application. But two cats were "
"petted."
msgstr ""
"Nijedna životinja nije povrijeđena tokom pravljenja ove aplikacije. Ali "
"dvije mačke su mažene."

#: src/splashes.rs:155
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Add videos to your watch-later list by bringing up their context menu, or "
"directly when watching videos."
msgstr ""
"Dodajte videozapise na listu za gledaj-kasnije otvaranjem njihovog "
"kontekstnog menija ili direktno tokom gledanja videozapisa."

#: src/splashes.rs:161
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Seeing something you don't like? You can hide videos from your feed based on "
"the title and uploader of the video."
msgstr ""
"Vidite nešto što vam se ne sviđa? Možete sakriti videozapise iz svog "
"napajanja na osnovu naslova i osobe koja ih je postavila."

#: src/splashes.rs:167
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can hide videos you already watched. Enable this by managing your "
"filters."
msgstr ""
"Možete sakriti videozapise koje ste već gledali. Omogućite to upravljanjem "
"filterima."

#: src/splashes.rs:173
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You can quickly toggle on and off filters in the feed from the filter dialog."
msgstr ""
"Filtere u napajanju možete brzo uključiti i isključiti iz dijaloga za "
"filtere."

#: src/splashes.rs:179
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to keep your subscriptions from YouTube or NewPipe? You can import "
"those into Pipeline."
msgstr ""
"Želite li zadržati svoje pretplate s YouTubea ili NewPipea? Možete ih uvesti "
"u Pipeline."

#: src/splashes.rs:185
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to bring your own video player instead of the one built-in? You can "
"manage an external video player in the settings and tell Pipeline to use it "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"Želite li koristiti vlastiti video čitač umjesto ugrađenog? Možete "
"upravljati eksternim video čitačem u postavkama i reći Pipeline-u da ga "
"koristi po zadanim postavkama."

#: src/splashes.rs:191
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"You want to keep a video you watched? You can directly download it from the "
"video page."
msgstr ""
"Želite sačuvati video koji ste pogledali? Možete ga direktno preuzeti sa "
"stranice videa."

#: src/splashes.rs:197
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Want to share a video? You can copy its URL to the clipboard directly from "
"the video page."
msgstr ""
"Želite li podijeliti video? Možete kopirati njegov URL u međuspremnik "
"direktno sa stranice videa."

#: src/splashes.rs:203
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Are you hosting your own Piped instance? You can tell Pipeline to use it in "
"the settings."
msgstr ""
"Da li držite vlastiti Piped primjerak? Možete reći Pipeline-u da je koristi "
"u postavkama."

#: src/splashes.rs:210
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Not interested in those splash texts? You can disable them in the settings."
msgstr "Ne zanimaju vas te uvodne poruke? Možete ih onemogućiti u postavkama."

#: src/splashes.rs:216
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Don't like YouTube anymore? Pipeline also works with <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTube</a>."
msgstr ""
"Više vam se ne sviđa YouTube? Pipeline također radi sa <a href=\"https://"
"joinpeertube.org\">PeerTubeom</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:222
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Searching for something? Pipeline can help you with that and search for "
"channels and videos on YouTube and Peertube."
msgstr ""
"Tražite nešto? Pipeline vam može pomoći u tome i pretraživati kanale i "
"videozapise na YouTubeu i Peertubeu."

#: src/splashes.rs:228
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Pipeline has four different ways to fetch videos from YouTube. Just to be "
"sure you don't miss any of your precious cat videos."
msgstr ""
"Pipeline ima četiri različita načina za preuzimanje videa s YouTubea. Samo "
"da biste bili sigurni da ne propustite nijedan od svojih dragocjenih videa o "
"mačkama."

#: src/splashes.rs:243
#, c-format
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid ""
"Have ideas for further splash text? Tell us on <a href=\"https://matrix.to/#/"
"%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrix</a>."
msgstr ""
"Imate li ideja za daljnji splash tekst? Recite nam na <a href=\"https://"
"matrix.to/#/%23pipelineapp:matrix.org\">Matrixu</a>."

#: src/splashes.rs:249
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Pretty sure {year} will be the year of the Linux desktop."
msgstr "Prilično sam siguran da će {year} biti godina Linux desktop računara."

#. Translators: A reference to the "I use Arch btw" meme.
#: src/splashes.rs:255
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "I can be used on Arch btw."
msgstr "Usput, mogu se koristiti na Archu."

#: src/splashes.rs:260
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "Do you want to advertise here? You can't."
msgstr "Želite li se ovdje oglašavati? Ne možete."

#: src/splashes.rs:277
msgctxt "Displayed as a splash text"
msgid "🎉 Pipeline turned {} years old today. Happy Birthday! 🎉"
msgstr "🎉 Pipeline je danas napunio {} godina. Sretan rođendan! 🎉"

